[TITLE]
Slot program fixture (d): valve-closure surge. Steady full-bore flow through
an in-line orifice that CONTROLS slam shut at t = 1 h; the pressure front
that forms is the surge the slot celerity governs. Gates: monotone head
rise at J1, no post-closure ringing, dt does not collapse at the front.

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
FLOW_ROUTING         FV
START_DATE           01/01/2026
START_TIME           00:00:00
END_DATE             01/01/2026
END_TIME             02:00:00
REPORT_STEP          00:00:30
ROUTING_STEP         0.25
FV_SLOT_CELERITY     100
LENGTHENING_STEP     0

[JUNCTIONS]
J0     100.0 80.0 0 0 0
J1     100.0 80.0 0 0 0

[OUTFALLS]
OF     100.0 FIXED 112.0 NO

[CONDUITS]
C1     J0   J1 1500 0.013 0 0 0

[ORIFICES]
;;Name From To Type Offset Cd Gated CloseTime
V1     J1   OF SIDE 0.0 0.65 NO 0

[XSECTIONS]
C1     CIRCULAR 3 0 0 0 1
V1     CIRCULAR 3 0 0 0 1

[INFLOWS]
J0     FLOW "" FLOW 1.0 1.0 40.0

[CONTROLS]
RULE SLAM
IF SIMULATION TIME > 1.0
THEN ORIFICE V1 SETTING = 0.0

[REPORT]
CONTINUITY YES
FLOWSTATS YES
NODES ALL
LINKS ALL
